    "locate": "Fresh stationary feedback on Native; unique existing target within +/-0.0005mm XY; final frame recheck; no nearest/old-point fallback. Read/verify only, no move/measurement/save. UI requires command success acknowledgement and blinks500ms for4s.",
    "cells": "Single view current Cell; overview explicit nonempty selected CellNos. Entire eligible Cell union -> one candidate/CSV/Undo. Pending absolute file limited to exact singleton; outside Cells preserved.",
    "values": "Actual/copied residual adds to target current B. Init current Cell immediately clears latest authoritative Review to absence/zero; other Cells/protected offsets retained.",
    "display": "Right pane shows measurement deviation and separately canonical saved final Review F, both DESIGN um. Colors/levels remain measurement based; NG red and missing/Init gray. No raw/base/candidate fallback for final F.",
    "monitor": "Latest same CSV is shared. Monitor row is transformed/scaled mm contribution, not raw deviation. Init->fresh fractional measure->Bulk->existing Monitor RefreshLiveData is checked at Scale100 and50."
  },
